# 🐳 Kryptos — Docker Setup

## Files Created

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| [Dockerfile](file:///c:/Users/novtw/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/Dockerfile) | Multi-stage build — builds all sub-project dependencies in parallel stages, then assembles a lean production image |
| [docker-compose.yml](file:///c:/Users/novtw/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/docker-compose.yml) | Orchestrates all 8 services (replaces PM2 [ecosystem.config.cjs](file:///c:/Users/novtw/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/ecosystem.config.cjs)) |
| [.dockerignore](file:///c:/Users/novtw/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/.dockerignore) | Keeps the build context small by excluding `node_modules`, `.git`, [.env](file:///c:/Users/novtw/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/.env), `*.sqlite`, logs, test files |

## Files Modified

| File | Change |
