| [registry.js](file:///c:/Users/novtw/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/kryptos-bridge/registry.js) | Relay node URLs now configurable via `KRYPTOS_RELAY_NODES` env var (Docker containers use hostnames, not `localhost`) |
